       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "toggle",
       "settings": {
        "tabs": [
         {
          "_id": "a8d4d82",
          "tab_title": "What's the difference between Exchange and POP3/IMAP?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Basic email (POP3/IMAP) gives you 20 email accounts and 20GB of shared storage on your own domain, for one flat price. Microsoft 365 runs on Exchange: full business mailboxes with 50GB each, shared calendars and contacts, Teams and the Office apps, priced per mailbox.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "90a6427",
          "tab_title": "Can I add mailboxes for new staff later?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes. Basic email includes 20 accounts, so you can add new staff any time. Microsoft 365 is priced per mailbox, so you add only what you need.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "9e568fa",
          "tab_title": "Do you filter spam and viruses?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes. Premium SpamExperts spam and virus filtering is included on every email plan, at no extra cost.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "5eb4cba",
          "tab_title": "Will it work on my phone?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Yes. There's secure webmail, and we can set your email up on Android and Apple devices.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "17f5218",
          "tab_title": "Do I need a domain first?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Your email runs on your own domain, like name@yourbusiness.com.au. If you don't have one yet, <a href=\"/domains/\">search for your domain</a> and we'll connect it to your email for you.</p>"
         },
         {
          "_id": "4652c6c",
          "tab_title": "Can I get Google email hosting?",
          "tab_content": "<p>Talk to us. Call <a href=\"tel:+61863654522\">08 6365 4522</a> and our Perth team will help you work out the right setup.</p>"
         }
        ],
        "selected_icon": {
         "value": "fas fa-plus",
         "library": "fa-solid"
        },
